{"3348270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carnal Sins: Malum Incarnatum + Carne Vescens", "steam_appid": 3348270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/229a5be28894cf7f78fce57784775fbc.avif?t=1756282060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras_big/229a5be28894cf7f78fce57784775fbc.webp?t=1756282060 width=1560 height=310 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience two short but unique psychological horror games in one horrific package. Dive into the twisted perceptions of love from two lost souls:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/ab9046118866a6858c967be818250edf.webp?t=1756282060\" width=628 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into human hell and unravel a life torn apart by the desire to love and be loved. Even if this longing for love only leads to evil growing inside one man's heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/e729599803e828ab31e00e9b39dcb04b.poster.avif?t=1756282060\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/e729599803e828ab31e00e9b39dcb04b.webm?t=1756282060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/e729599803e828ab31e00e9b39dcb04b.mp4?t=1756282060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/4112dac25205e2a038d152304555c4ed.webp?t=1756282060\" width=628 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in her apartment, a mother finds herself unable to keep her insatiable baby fed. So she decides to feed her baby the only bit of food she has left: Herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/729f494d7344895777d219e6c894ae5a.poster.avif?t=1756282060\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/729f494d7344895777d219e6c894ae5a.webm?t=1756282060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/729f494d7344895777d219e6c894ae5a.mp4?t=1756282060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348270/extras/5393db1e9734227d95136fa9c0bedb43.avif?t=1756282060\" width=627 height=77 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange, monochromatic environments full of surreal imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics inspired by late 90s PSX-games and old black-and-white horror movies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Videos (FMVs) and voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support for every modern PC-compatible controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret endings in both games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as